OL,3,GNEWSACounty signs stolen as mementos,
OL,4,Aleader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Rutland County Council
OL,7,Fbelieves a decision to abolish the
OL,8,Fauthority has led to a spate of signs
OL,9,Fbeing stolen as mementos of England's
OL,10,Fsmallest county.
OL,12,FPolice are investigating after 10 signs
OL,13,Fon the border of Rutland were "removed
OL,14,Fwithout permission".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
