OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACounty signs stolen as mementos,
OL,4,Aleader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristine Wise, the Liberal Democrat
OL,7,Fleader of the county council, said the
OL,8,Fsigns started to go missing in July
OL,9,Fshortly after the government announced
OL,10,Fa major redrawing of the local
OL,11,Fpolitical map, which will see the
OL,12,Fcounty council merge with
OL,13,FLeicestershire authorities.
OL,15,F"There's a suspicion people were taking
OL,16,Fthem for sentimental or nostalgic
OL,17,Freasons," Wise said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
